l":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huult/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding and email contributors@expensify.com to request to join our Slack channel!\n___\n\n**Version Number:** v9.4.20-0\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** Yes\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://github.com/Expensify/App/pull/93301\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** N/A\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Pull Request QA execution\n**Device used:** Windows 10\n**App Component:** Other\n\n## Action Performed:\nPrecondition: User has not validate account yet\n\n1. While online, go to Wallet > Add bank account\n2. Reach the magic-code screen so a code is requested. Verify a code is received and the countdown starts.\n2. Go offline. Verify the countdown timer is hidden and the Verify / \"didn't receive a code\" controls are disabled.\n3. Within 30 seconds of having opened the screen, reload the page (while still offline)\n4. Go back online. Verify no duplicate magic-code email/SMS is sent as a result of the offline reload.\nResult: When the app reconnects after the page is reloaded while offline, a second magic code is sent.\n\n## Expected Result:\nAfter reloading the page while offline and then reconnecting, no additional magic code should be sent.\n\n## Actual Result:\nWhen the app reconnects after the page is reloaded while offline, a second magic code is sent. The second code is different from the original\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2bce8557-22b2-4fe8-a8e5-ea4974f8ad6d\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Julia Ponikarchuk\n> Bug ID: 7192060\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022070546671400353651\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022070546671400353651</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2070546671400353651</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-03</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @huult</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94716/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94716/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rsoreq-mend/tensorflow/issues/35","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rsoreq-mend/tensorflow","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rsoreq-mend/tensorflow/issues/35/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rsoreq-mend/tensorflow/issues/35/comments","