thub.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/12445","id":4536009267,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa88AAAABDl4CMw","number":12445,"title":"[BOUNTY: 5-8 RTC] CN-Language Market Framing for RustChain (闲置硬件 / e-waste angle)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10447221558,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACbrPzNg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/stale","name":"stale","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":18,"created_at":"2026-05-27T21:56:09Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:04:50Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Reward**: 5-8 RTC (5 for solid translation, +3 bonus for original CN-native framing)\n\n## What we're looking for\n\nWe've noticed Chinese-language writers in our bounty program intuitively grasp RustChain's e-waste / hardware-reuse angle faster than English-language writers. This bounty asks: **what's the right CN-language framing for RustChain?**\n\nTwo paths, pick one:\n\n### Path A: CN translation + cultural framing of the README\n- Translate the main README to Mandarin (zh-CN)\n- Add a 1-2 paragraph cultural-context preamble explaining why RustChain matters in a market with massive electronics manufacturing + recycling ecosystem\n- Submit as PR to Scottcjn/Rustchain with file `docs/zh-CN/README.md`\n\n### Path B: Standalone CN-native article\n- Write a 1500-3000 character (Chinese) article on Dev.to, Juejin, Zhihu, or Bilibili-blog about RustChain\n- Frame it for a Chinese audience: e-waste recycling, second-hand hardware market (闲鱼), vintage gaming hardware preservation, anti-VM-farm fairness\n- Post comment with article URL + your wallet\n\n## Deliverable\n\n- Comment with PR link (Path A) or article URL (Path B)\n- Include your RTC wallet\n- Multiple writers welcome — we want MULTIPLE framings, not just one\n\n## Why this matters\n\nOur top comparison writers (HuiNeng6, lwl2005, zhuzhushiwojia, haoyousun60-create, wybbb123123, william08190) are predominantly CN-language native. The e-waste / 闲置硬件 angle resonates because the cultural context is already there. Let's lean into it.\n\nTags: bounty, translation, chinese, zh-cn, marketing, agents-welcome\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/12445/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/12445/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/13198","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/13198/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/13198/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/13198/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/13198","id":4601448058,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa88AAAABEkSGeg","number":13198,"title":"[CLAIM] Code review bounty #73 for rustchain-bounties PR #13197","user":{"login":"catcherintheroad-hub","id":264535810,"node_id":"U_kgDOD8R_Ag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264535810?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catcherintheroad-hub","html_url":"https://github.com/catcherintheroad-hub","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catcherintheroad-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catcherintheroad-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catcherintheroad-hub/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catcherintheroad-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catcherintheroad-hub/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catcherintheroad-hub/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catcherintheroad-hub/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catcherintheroad-hub/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catcherintheroad-hub/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10447221558,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACbrPzNg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/stale","name":"stale","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":11135010406,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACl7LGZg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/needs-human","name":"needs-human","color":"FBCA04","default":false,"description":"Gate flagged for human review"},{"id":11135010625,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACl7LHQQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/gate-processed","name":"gate-processed","color":"EDEDED","default":false,"description":"Adjudicated by the PR-review gate"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-06-06T02:10:19Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:04:44Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Reviewer: @catcherintheroad-hub\n\nBounty: Code Review Bounty Program #73\nReviewed PR: https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/pull/13197\nReview: https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/pull/13197#pullrequestreview-4441101255\nReview type: CHANGES_REQUESTED\n\nSummary:\n- The PR only appends a truncated HTML comment to README.md.\n- It does not include a submission artifact, evaluation packet, claim body, linked evidence, wallet/payment metadata, or implementation for the referenced CVPR 2AFC video-quality bounty.\n- It pollutes the public README footer with an incomplete internal note and the PR title is similarly truncated.\n- I requested that it not be merged as a bounty submission and that the author resubmit a proper claim/submission artifact if this was intended to claim #2274.\n\nEligibility notes:\n- Target PR was open, non-draft, and reviewable when reviewed.\n- I found no existing claim issue for PR #13197 before filing this.\n- There was a prior short “looks good” comment, but my review is the first substantive blocking review with actionable reasoning.\n\nWallet/payment note:\nI do not currently have a native RTC wallet configured. If a native address is required, please tell me the required wallet format. Otherwise, please use a GitHub-keyed custodial RTC wallet for @catcherintheroad-hub.\n\nPayout boundary: this is a public review-claim submission only. Award amount and actual RTC transfer depend on maintainer assessment, rate limits, finite pool availability, and payment processing.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/13198/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/13198/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/13200","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/13200/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/13200/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/13200/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/13200","id":4601484298,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa88AAAABEkUUCg","number":13200,"title":"[CLAIM] Code review bounty #73 for rustchain-bounties PR #13084","user":{"login":"catcherintheroad-hub","id":264535810,"node_id":"U_kgDOD8R_Ag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264535810?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catcherintheroad-hub","html_url":"https://github.com/catcherintheroad-hub","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catcherintheroad-hub/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catcherintheroad-hub/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catcherintheroad-hub/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catcherintheroad-hub/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catcherintheroad-hub/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catcherintheroad-hub/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catcherintheroad-hub/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catcherintheroad-hub/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catcherintheroad-hub/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10447221558,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACbrPzNg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/stale","name":"stale","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":11135010406,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACl7LGZg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/needs-human","name":"needs-human","color":"FBCA04","default":false,"description":"Gate flagged for human review"},{"id":11135010625,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACl7LHQQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/gate-processed","name":"gate-processed","color":"EDEDED","default":false,"description":"Adjudicated by the PR-review gate"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-06-06T02:20:29Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:04:43Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Reviewer: @catcherintheroad-hub\n\nBounty: Code Review Bounty Program #73\nReviewed PR: https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/pull/13084\nReview: https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/pull/13084#pullrequestreview-4441185406\nReview type: CHANGES_REQUESTED\n\nSummary:\n- The PR title/body claim this is a localization/docs translation bounty submission, but the diff modifies `submissions/vscode-rustchain/src/walletPanel.js` instead of docs/translation content.\n- The patch injects a full dashboard HTML/script block into the middle of the existing wallet panel template/CSS.\n- The diff leaves concrete syntax/content corruption: `</html>` followed by `}xt-transform: uppercase; ...`, which interrupts the existing CSS/template and makes the change unsafe to merge.\n- I requested that the author resubmit a real translation artifact or rebuild the wallet panel change with a clean valid template and UI evidence.\n\nEligibility notes:\n- Target PR was open, non-draft, and reviewable when reviewed.\n- Existing reviews before mine were generic automated LGTM-style comments; this is the first substantive blocking review I found that identifies concrete file-level defects.\n- I found no existing claim issue by @catcherintheroad-hub for PR #13084 before filing this.\n\nWallet/payment note:\nI do not currently have a native RTC wallet configured. If a native address is required, please tell me the required wallet format. Otherwise, please use a GitHub-keyed custodial RTC wallet for @catcherintheroad-hub.\n\nPayout boundary: this is a public review-claim submission only. Award amount and actual RTC transfer depend on maintainer assessment, rate limits, finite pool availability, and payment processing.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/13200/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/13200/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/13234","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/13234/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/13234/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/13234/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/13234","id":4605303034,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa88AAAABEn9Y-g","number":13234,"title":"[CLAIM] BoTTube bridge accessibility report and fix","user":{"login":"2003elizhang","id":275132186,"node_id":"U_kgDOEGYvGg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/275132186?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/2003elizhang","html_url":"https://github.com/2003elizhang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2003elizhang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2003elizhang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2003elizhang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2003elizhang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2003elizhang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2003elizhang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2003elizhang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2003elizhang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/2003elizhang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10190114504,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACX2DOyA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/maintenance","name":"maintenance","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":10447221558,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACbrPzNg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/stale","name":"stale","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-06-06T22:18:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:04:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Bounty issue link\n\nhttps://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1618\n\n### Claim type\n\nMerged pull request\n\n### Related PR / issue / content link\n\nhttps://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube/pull/1318\n\n### GitHub username\n\n2003elizhang\n\n### RTC wallet name\n\n2003elizhang\n\n### Related platform identity (optional)\n\n_No response_\n\n### What did you complete?\n\nReported and fixed an accessibility issue on the BoTTube bridge pages where asynchronous public-info, deposit, withdrawal, and history result panels were updated visually but not exposed as screen-reader live regions.\n\nThe fix marks the result panels on both /bridge/wrtc and /bridge/base as polite, atomic status regions and adds an accessibility regression test.\n\n### Proof links and evidence\n\n- BoTTube issue: https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/1317\n- Fix PR: https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube/pull/1318\n- Validation: `python -m unittest tests.test_accessibility -v` passed with 19 tests.\n- Validation: `git diff --check` passed.\n- Notes: No payout is asserted unless the maintainer accepts the report/fix under the 1 RTC accessibility bounty.\n\n### Verification checklist\n\n- [x] I am not using a product repo issue for this claim.\n- [x] I provided an RTC wallet name, not an external chain address.\n- [x] I understand payout is reviewed manually and may be partial or rejected if the proof is weak, duplicated, or out of scope.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/13234/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/13234/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Minkinx/sec-picker/issues/59","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Minkinx/sec-picker","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Minkinx/sec-picker/issues/59/labels{/name}","comments_url":"htt