e text\n## Actual Result:\nThe message text cannot be selected or highlighted.\nUsers are unable to copy the content of the system message.\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n## Platforms:\nSelect the officially supported platforms where the issue was reproduced:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/85e2343c-ff9e-4cf1-b02f-3d4950e90940\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @thesahindia</details>\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022031119289878700840</li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2031119289878700840</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-03-16</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/84639/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/84639/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SAST-UP-STG/SAST-Test-Repo-6bc3d218-0ff2-475d-8015-0fcb64b99660/issues/55","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SAST-UP-STG/SAST-Test-Repo-6bc3d218-0ff2-475d-8015-0fcb64b99660","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SAST-UP-STG/SAST-Test-Repo-6bc3d218-0ff2-475d-8015-0fcb64b99660/issues/55/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SAST-UP-STG/SAST-Test-Repo-6bc3d218-0ff2-475d-8015-0fcb64b99660/issues/55/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SAST-UP-STG/SAST-Test-Repo-6bc3d218-0ff2-475d-8015-0fcb64b99660/issues/55/events","html_url":"http