ezf/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcochavezf/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcochavezf/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcochavezf/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcochavezf/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding and email contributors@expensify.com to request to join our Slack channel!\n___\n\n**Version Number:**\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Needs Reproduction \n**Reproducible in production?:** Needs Reproduction\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:**\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):**\n**Logs:** https://stackoverflow.com/c/expensify/questions/4856\n**Expensify/Expensify Issue URL:**\n**Issue reported by:** @allgandalf \n**Slack conversation** (hyperlinked to channel name): [#Quality](https://expensify.slack.com/archives/C05LX9D6E07/p1778494855419079)\n\n## Action Performed:\n\n1. Log into staging web\n2. Wait until the session expires in the background\n3. Attempt any action (e.g., sending a message or opening a report)\n4. Observe that the request fails, but the user remains logged in\n\n## Expected Result:\nOnce the session expires, the app should automatically sign the user out or redirect them to the login screen with a clear message that the session has expired.\n\n## Actual Result:\nThe user remains on the app with an expired session and is not redirected to sign in again.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\nSelect the officially supported platforms where the issue was reproduced:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nThe video and onyx data for the issue are in Slack [thread](https://expensify.slack.com/archives/C05LX9D6E07/p1778494855419079)\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022054610494997573872</li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2054610494997573872</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-05-20</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @mallenexpensify</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90544/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90544/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2786","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2786/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2786/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2786/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2786","id":4195438556,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa876EU_c","number":2786,"title":"[ONBOARD: 2 RTC] Compare RustChain to Another Blockchain Project","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://